abstract: >-
  Maple worksheets and procedures, with a MATLAB script, for the quasinormal modes of the scalar and axial
  perturbations of massive static phantom (Ellis–Bronnikov) wormholes. The outgoing behaviour at both mouths is built
  into a factorisation of the solution, the whole line is compactified, and a Chebyshev collocation in multiprecision
  arithmetic gives a quadratic eigenvalue problem solved with polyeig and the Advanpix toolbox; its purely imaginary
  modes reveal the instabilities of the wormhole.
